  "details": "Hey!\nI just started playing the game and I love it! There is one thing which I think is pretty cool, and useful in different ways.\nSo basically my idea is a system where u can click on your friends in the Social tab and create a \"whisper\". The whisper is a short recorded message you can send to that person to playback in a different world. The player recording should automatically be put in mute for the world to not give away any information.",
